    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i want to feel new stuff. everything just feels like a chore. even breathing feels like something i'm only doing cuz i haven't been told to stop yet. there's no version of the future where i'm actually \"me\" again. it's just more of this emptiness.",
